            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Thuidium tamariscinum is a species of moss belonging to the family Thuidiaceae. It has an almost cosmopolitan distribution."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "In a study of the effect of the herbicide Asulam on moss growth, Thuidium tamariscinum was shown to have intermediate sensitivity to Asulam exposure."
          }
